{"ID":"20240205170448-ln7essx","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205170448-ln7essx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170448-ln7essx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170607-bjxm7kx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612155208-w1o7hk2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627154918-dd4rmnn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"257铅丹（黄丹）","type":"doc","updated":"20240822093117"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205170607-bjxm7kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170607-bjxm7kx","updated":"20240205170607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"铅丹"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/铅丹-20240205170607-k2v25xr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240627154918-dd4rmnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627154918-dd4rmnn","updated":"20240627155752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 420px;","style":"width: 410px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"铅丹"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/铅丹-20240627155752-lvi7xt7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 410px;\" parent-style=\"width: 420px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822092858-t4bfkgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822092858-t4bfkgb","updated":"20240822093117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：由纯铅加工制成，化学名为四氧化三铅；"}]},{"ID":"20240612155207-s8cxn9h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155207-s8cxn9h"}},{"ID":"20240612155427-44x0b92","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155427-44x0b92","updated":"20240612155431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155427-k304a7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155427-k304a7z","updated":"20240612155427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155427-vsvewq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155427-vsvewq4","updated":"20240612155427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主土逆胃反，惊痫瘨疾，除热下气，炼化还成九光。久服通神明（《御览》引作吐下，云久服成仙）。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155427-detdcgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155427-detdcgd","updated":"20240612155427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名铅华，生蜀郡。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155427-3luusor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155427-3luusor","updated":"20240612155427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：铅，青金也。陶宏景云：即今熬铅所作黄丹也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155436-avys9l0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155436-avys9l0"}},{"ID":"20240612155437-6rmv1o8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155437-6rmv1o8","updated":"20240612155442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155437-2xkg8ec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155437-2xkg8ec","updated":"20240612155437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，微寒。主咳逆，胃反，惊痫，癫疾，除热，下气。止小便利，除毒热脐挛，金疮溢血。练化还成九光，久服通神明。生蜀郡平泽。一名铅华，生于铅。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155437-excdg9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155437-excdg9s","updated":"20240612155437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即今熬铅所作黄丹画用者，俗方亦希用，唯《仙经》涂丹釜所须此。云化成九光者，当谓九光炼法。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155437-g9zi6d3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155437-g9zi6d3","updated":"20240612155437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕丹、白二粉俱炒锡作，今经称铅丹，陶云熬铅，俱误也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155519-4fio8vf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155519-4fio8vf"}},{"ID":"20240612155520-lc9yxa8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155520-lc9yxa8","updated":"20240612155524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155520-l263kch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155520-l263kch","updated":"20240612155520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本谓之黄丹，化铅而成，别有法。《唐本》注∶炒锡作。然经称铅丹，则炒锡之说误矣，亦不为难辨。盖锡则色黯暗，铅则明白，以此为异。治疟及久积皆用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155506-vrf29kh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155506-vrf29kh"}},{"ID":"20240612155507-lxqkup6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155507-lxqkup6","updated":"20240612155513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155507-tjtlvvq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155507-tjtlvvq","updated":"20240612155507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，微寒。主治咳逆，胃反，惊痫，癫疾，除热，下气。止小便利，除毒热脐挛，金疮溢血。炼化还成九光。久服通神明。生蜀郡平泽。一名铅华，生于铅。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155507-vhc8frn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155507-vhc8frn","updated":"20240612155507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即今熬铅所作黄丹画用者，世方亦稀用，唯《仙经》涂丹釜所须此。云化成九光者，当为九光丹以为釜耳，无别变炼法。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155447-7tjb7do","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155447-7tjb7do"}},{"ID":"20240612155449-8djh12v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155449-8djh12v","updated":"20240612155453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155449-l1stmzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155449-l1stmzx","updated":"20240612155449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（日华）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155449-2e5xv10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155449-2e5xv10","updated":"20240612155449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】辛，微寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155449-grusc9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155449-grusc9v","updated":"20240612155449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主吐逆反胃，惊痫癫疾，除热、下气，炼化还成九光，久服通神明。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155449-cedltyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155449-cedltyw","updated":"20240612155449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶铅丹，原生于铅，出蜀郡平泽。近皆炒铅为之，法用每铅一斤，以土硫黄十两，硝石一两。熔铅成汁，下醋点之，俟 沸时，遂下硫黄一块，少顷，再下硝少许，沸定再点醋，依前下少许硝、黄，待自作末，则成丹矣。近多以作粉铅脚，不 成粉者，用矾石、硝石，合炒成丹，力转薄矣。若欲转丹为铅，只用莲须葱白汁，拌丹漫煎， 成金汁，倾出土上，即还铅矣。市肆者，每以盐硝砂石杂乱。凡用须用净水漂去硝盐，飞去砂石，澄干，微火漫炒，紫赤色，置土地上，摊去火毒，乃入药用。会典云∶黑铅一斤，烧丹可得一斤五钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155449-ucpfnlr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155449-ucpfnlr","updated":"20240612155449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶铅秉重玄，五金水也。点烹成丹，碎大块作太末，转丹还铅，会太末归太玄，下而上，外而内，元始合璧，动定九光，丹体备已。故主吐逆反胃，惊走狂癫，下而上者，上而下矣。痫疾下气，忤恶聚积，外而内者，内而外矣。水济火则热除，火济水则通神，丹成敌应，莫捷于铅。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155601-e5iszy3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155601-e5iszy3"}},{"ID":"20240612155602-9ztiaur","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155602-9ztiaur","updated":"20240612155607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155602-cevyudl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155602-cevyudl","updated":"20240612155602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名黄丹"}]},{"ID":"20240612155602-mzjr8r8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155602-mzjr8r8","updated":"20240612155602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛微寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155602-wqjs8vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155602-wqjs8vh","updated":"20240612155602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》治吐逆胃反，惊痫癫疾，除热下气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155602-2qaixk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155602-2qaixk4","updated":"20240612155602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹体重性沉，味兼盐矾，而走血分，能坠痰止疟。《本经》言，止吐逆胃反，治惊痫癫疾，除热下气，取其性重以镇逆满也。仲景柴胡龙骨牡蛎汤用之，取其入胆以祛痰积也；但内无积滞，误服不能无伤胃夺食之患。敷疮长肉、坠痰杀虫，皆铅之本性耳。目暴赤痛，铅丹蜜调贴太阳穴立效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155546-rru1mzy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155546-rru1mzy"}},{"ID":"20240612155547-yvswp2m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155547-yvswp2m","updated":"20240612155555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155547-0a0gp9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155547-0a0gp9e","updated":"20240612155547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即黄丹。性味咸寒，解热拔毒。虽有内治之功，与铅同性，复经盐矾炼成，大损真阳不可轻用。铅粉功忌略同。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155625-42lqngo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155625-42lqngo"}},{"ID":"20240612155626-mfcuxfz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155626-mfcuxfz","updated":"20240612155631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155626-2tgo8qb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155626-2tgo8qb","updated":"20240612155626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒沉重．入手足太阴少阴经．功专坠痰止惊．单用涂黄水疮神效．得龙骨牡蛎．治心脏神惊．一名黄丹．"}]},{"ID":"20240612155531-uun19m9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155531-uun19m9"}},{"ID":"20240612155532-1jzugv0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155532-1jzugv0","updated":"20240612155538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155532-0rx1ri3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155532-0rx1ri3","updated":"20240612155532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】味辛微寒。主土逆胃反，惊痫瘨疾，除热下气，炼化还成九光。久服通神明。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155532-1lqkocm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155532-1lqkocm","updated":"20240612155532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，入足少阳胆经、足厥阴肝经。降摄神魂，镇安惊悸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155532-zcx9oco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155532-zcx9oco","updated":"20240612155532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《伤寒》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡加龙骨牡蛎汤"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在龙骨。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之治少阳伤寒，胸满烦惊，以其降逆而敛魂也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155532-v1i0z2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155532-v1i0z2f","updated":"20240612155532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹沉重降敛，宁神魂而安惊悸。其诸主治，疗疮疡，去翳膜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155241-m9hb8sd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155241-m9hb8sd"}},{"ID":"20240612155417-hv6lgr4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155417-hv6lgr4","updated":"20240612155421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155417-828ozp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155417-828ozp3","updated":"20240612155417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，微寒。主吐逆，胃反，惊痫癫疾，除热，下气，止小便利，除毒热脐挛，金疮溢血，炼化还成丸光。久服通神明。一名铅华，生于铅，生蜀郡平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155242-o3zpbz2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155242-o3zpbz2"}},{"ID":"20240612155408-6x733i5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155408-6x733i5","updated":"20240612155412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155408-d52ztf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155408-d52ztf8","updated":"20240612155408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，微寒，主吐逆胃反，惊痫癫疾，除热下气，止小便利，除毒热脐挛，金疮溢血。炼化还成九光，久服通神明。一名铅华，生于铅。生蜀郡平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155408-o8zzu0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155408-o8zzu0d","updated":"20240612155408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶即今熬铅所作黄丹也。画用者，俗方亦稀用，唯《仙经》涂丹釜所须，云化成九光者，当谓九光丹以为釜尔，无别变炼法。唐本注云∶丹、白二粉，俱炒锡作，今《经》称铅丹，陶云熬铅，俱误矣。今注∶此即今黄丹也，与粉锡二物，俱是化铅为之。按李含光《音义》云∶黄丹，胡粉皆化铅，未闻用锡者，故参同契云∶若胡粉投炭中，色坏为铅。《抱朴子·内篇》云∶愚人乃不信黄丹及胡粉是化铅所作，今唐注以三物俱炒锡，大误矣。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶铅丹，君。主治惊悸狂走，呕逆，消渴。煎膏用，止痛生肌。萧炳云∶臣，不入汤。日华子云∶黄丹，凉，无毒。镇心安神，疗反胃，止吐血及嗽，敷金疮长肉，及汤火疮，染须发。可煎膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155408-cbfssz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155408-cbfssz8","updated":"20240612155408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具铅、锡条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155408-xaeo7rb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155408-xaeo7rb","updated":"20240612155408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"外台秘要∶《集验》疗逆产方∶真丹刀圭，涂儿跖下。肘后方∶客忤，中恶之类，多于道间得之，令人心腹疼痛，胀满，气冲心胸，不即治亦害人。救之方∶真丹方寸匕，蜜三合和服之，口噤者折齿灌之。又方∶治伤寒及时气，温病头痛壮热，脉盛。真丹涂行身令遍，向火坐令汗出。又方∶蝎螫人，黄丹醋调涂之。经验方∶碧霞丹∶治吐逆立效。北来黄丹四两筛过，用好米醋半升，同药入铫内煎令干，却用炭火三秤，就铫内 透红，冷，取研细为末，用粟米饭丸如桐子大。煎酵汤下七丸，不嚼，只一服。王氏博济∶治风痫驱风散∶铅丹二两，白矾二两，为末。用砖一口，以纸铺砖上，先以丹铺纸上，次以矾铺丹上，然后用纸捅，却将十斤柳木柴烧过为度，取出细研。每服一钱，温酒下。刘氏∶治小儿疟方∶黄丹两钱匕，以蜜水和与服，冷即以酒和，令服之良。子母秘录∶治小儿重舌方∶黄丹如豆大，内管中，以安舌下。治疟百草霜∶黄丹等分细研。每服二钱匕，于发日空心米饮调服，不过两服愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155408-8yms29h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155408-8yms29h","updated":"20240612155408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶铅丹，本谓之黄丹，化铅而成。别有法，《唐本》注∶炒锡作。然《经》称铅丹，则炒锡之说误矣。亦不为难辨，盖锡则以黯暗，铅则明白，以此为异。治疟及久积皆用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155242-fpjll66","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155242-fpjll66"}},{"ID":"20240612155358-v9o2a0a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-v9o2a0a","updated":"20240612155403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-fswdmgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-fswdmgk","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名黄丹。可入丸散。熬膏药。不入汤用。炒铅丹法。用铅一斤。土硫黄十两。硝石一两。熔铅成汁。下醋点之。滚沸时。下硫一块。少顷下硝少许。沸定。再点醋。依前下少许黄硝。待为末。即成丹。（会典云。黑铅一斤。烧丹一斤五钱三分。）若转丹为铅。只用连须葱白汁拌丹慢煎。成金汁。倾出即还铅矣。（濒湖）今人以作铅粉。不尽者用硝石矾石炒成丹。（又）味微辛咸。气微寒。体重。性沉。内走血分。伏砒。制硫。内服。治吐逆胃反。惊痫癫疾。除热下气。（本经）除消渴。消积痢久积及疟。止衄血并痔证下血不止。疗热毒脐挛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-mmxu2kp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-mmxu2kp","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（当脐挛急而痛是阴阳不得升降也）中恶心腹胀痛。能固气敛神气。坠痰。杀虫。治疳疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-imt1l30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-imt1l30","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（诸本草）外敷生肌止痛止血。诸疮金疮汤火疮。或煎膏用之。能解热拔毒。长肉去瘀。故治恶疮肿毒。及入膏药。为外科必用之药。（濒湖）鼻衄初出。多不能止。此肺金受相火所制也。用黄丹吹入鼻中。吐逆不止。北黄丹四两。米醋半升。煎干。炭火三秤。就铫内红。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-gja2t7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-gja2t7a","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冷定为末。粟米饭丸梧子大。每服七丸。醋汤下。小儿瘅疟。壮热不寒。黄丹二钱。蜜水和服。冷者酒服。温疟不止。黄丹炒半两。青蒿童便浸二两。为末。每服二钱。寒多酒服。热多茶服。反胃气逆胃虚。铅丹二两。白矾二两。生石亭脂半两。先以丹矾研匀。入坩锅内。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-hssjwr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-hssjwr5","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用炭半秤赤。更养一夜。出毒两日。入亭脂同研。粟米饮和丸。绿豆大。每日米饮下十五丸。风痫发止。铅丹二两。白矾二两。为末。用三角砖相斗。以七层纸铺砖上。铺丹于纸上。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-bm1yve5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-bm1yve5","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铺矾丹上。用柳木柴十斤。烧过为度。取研。每服二钱。温酒下。眼生珠管。铅丹半两。鲤鱼胆汁和如膏。日点三五次。咽喉肿痛。追风散。用黄丹朴硝牙皂砂仁壳各五钱。为细末。每以鹅毛蘸药少许。敷舌上下及肿处。后以温水灌漱。外痔肿痛。黄丹滑石。等分为末。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-a4i9n9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-a4i9n9z","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"新汲水调〔论〕夫就铅霜而言。铅汞固为一气之交感矣。（即取水银粉毒。用黑铅作壶。煮土茯苓酒服之。是交感之一证。）就铅丹而言。铅合硫硝炒制。是何一水一火。其交感又如是耶。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-wl9pip6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-wl9pip6","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（硫恋于铅。硫又能死铅。铅得硫则化。即治溲闭一案可验。详见硫黄条。然解硫毒者。还用黑铅煎汤解之。）盖天一生水。地二生火。在人身水火同宫。故硫与铅交感而交化。至阳者恋乎阴而得所归。至阴者合于阳而行其化。阳得所归则火降。阴行其化则水升。水火之气和。而气血亦和。此铅丹所以能除热下气。治吐逆反胃及惊痫癫狂烦渴诸疾。而外敷疮疡更效也。又按铅丹主治有数证。可以参其微义。如齿衄属肾虚者。服凉药反甚。宜盐汤下安肾丸。间进黑锡丹。此因火乘水虚而上。或兼痰气壅塞。必用铅硫结砂子者为主剂。而和以温补肾气。方能奏功。至神效方治痔疾下血不止。固以皮为痔证专剂矣。其用白矾者。是收阴于亢阳之中。以散阳邪而救真阴也。用绿矾火者。俾之理脾阴。和脾气。转为血脏地也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-7wdnoyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-7wdnoyj","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入伏龙肝者。更欲用阳以化阴。俾湿化行而血乃化。且又不属燥剂。而铅丹则固相助为理者也。又治八般头风。用草乌尖细辛。必入铅丹少许以和血。正为风脏即血脏也。消瘅证心中热渴欲饮者。用乌金散。止铅丹细墨二味合治也。久痢脐腹撮痛者。治以圣饼子。乃铅丹合于定粉陀僧硫黄轻粉。同为相感相交之气味以化其积滞也。内治数证。举此可以类推。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-yqj56mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-yqj56mc","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吐逆由于胃虚。及因寒发吐者。皆不宜服。（仲淳）〔修治〕货者多以盐硝砂石杂之。凡入药用水漂去硝盐。飞去砂石。澄干。微火炒紫色。地上去火毒用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-hitwwgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-hitwwgx","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔总论铅霜铅丹灵砂〕黑锡之用。杂水银作片。醋薰成霜者。名铅白霜。合硫硝制为末者。名曰铅丹。而汞合硫以升者。为灵砂。又汞合于硝矾升者。为轻粉。铅霜铅丹灵砂。似其主治不远。但铅霜惟取坎离之纯阴。其所交感而出为精华者。以故上焦热可使清降。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155358-pjrxxur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155358-pjrxxur","updated":"20240612155358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上焦热所生痰可使镇坠。是病于阳之偏胜。乃其对待。至铅丹取铅同宫之阳以化阴。石硫是也。更藉硝石之苦温而上胜者。同硫气以升阳。使至阴随阳以升。而清坠上焦之亢阳。所谓藉升以为降也。是病于阴不升而阳不降者。此其中的之治。若灵砂则治上盛下虚者。阳极于上。阴竭于下。阴阳将离而欲绝。最为危笃。故取阳中之阴下行者。阴中之阳上行者。两相感而两相结。以交水火而媾阴阳。所谓斡旋于俄顷。徐为养阴驭阳之计者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155242-ymj6mma","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155242-ymj6mma"}},{"ID":"20240612155346-vtltow5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155346-vtltow5","updated":"20240612155350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155346-zou4ok1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155346-zou4ok1","updated":"20240612155346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹有毒味辛凉，生肌止血治诸疮，吐逆颠痫消久积，截疟镇惊神气藏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155346-sxqquvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155346-sxqquvn","updated":"20240612155346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒铅为丹，其色黄，故又名黄丹。善生肌止痛止血，诸疮、金疮、汤火、染须，皆用煎膏或末敷之。主吐逆翻胃，癫痫狂疾，除热毒脐挛，中恶心腹胀痛，又能消久积，止温疟，镇心安神，去惊狂烦渴。经云∶黄丹涩而固气，收敛神气以镇惊也。丹溪云∶曾一妇因多子，于月内服黄丹二两，四肢冰冷强直，不食，时正仲冬，急服附子理中汤数十帖而定。炒黄丹法∶黑铅一斤，土硫黄、硝石各一两，先溶铅成汁，下醋点之，滚沸时下黄一小块，续下硝少许，沸定再点醋，根据前下少许硝、黄，已消沸定黄亦尽，炒为末成丹矣，入药又炒令色变，细研水飞二遍。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155242-8mg6imq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155242-8mg6imq"}},{"ID":"20240612155303-5d1o8bt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-5d1o8bt","updated":"20240612155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅丹《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-j91tgqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-j91tgqd","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】本品为纯铅加工而成的四氧化三铅。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-b97bj5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-b97bj5i","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】辛，微寒。有毒。入脾、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-74cs17a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-74cs17a","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】外用拔毒生肌；内服杀虫，截疟。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-ymd7mck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-ymd7mck","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】用于疮疡多脓。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-zy7yjfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-zy7yjfn","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品主要外用于散剂及膏药中，能与植物油化合，为制膏药的基础剂，有较好的解毒收敛作用。如经验方红油膏，即用本品配合九一丹（熟石膏九钱、升丹一钱），调入油膏内，有防腐生肌作用，可治溃疡不敛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-u9kgd7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-u9kgd7n","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，内服小量可坠痰截疟，又可用于虫积腹痛，因本品有毒，故目前临床上极少应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-75tf3xu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-75tf3xu","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】铅丹、黄丹、广丹、东丹"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-j90zajf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-j90zajf","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】内服一分至二分，入丸散。不可过量，以防中毒。外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-ih044tj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-ih044tj","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《本经》：「主吐逆胃反，惊痫癫疾。」"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-qglo3ua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-qglo3ua","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《药性本草》：「煎膏用止痛生肌。」"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-whix080","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-whix080","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草衍义》：「治疟及久积。」"}]},{"ID":"20240612155303-axe28gi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155303-axe28gi","updated":"20240612155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草纲目》：「坠痰杀虫。」"}]},{"ID":"20240612155242-utb4hvd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155242-utb4hvd"}},{"ID":"20240612155247-dsdq8ry","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-dsdq8ry","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：铅丹"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-04c7lcu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-04c7lcu","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-iczwfcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-iczwfcg","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qiān Dān"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-w8h844m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-w8h844m","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-ny2zs50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-ny2zs50","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 黄丹、朱丹、红丹、漳丹、彰丹、朱粉、松丹、陶丹、铅黄、丹粉"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-n0tix5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-n0tix5f","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-pbaoxma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-pbaoxma","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为纯铅经加工制造而成的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"四氧化三铅"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（PB3O4）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-taz2u8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-taz2u8l","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-dy2w9y5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-dy2w9y5","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 橙黄色或橙红色质重的细粉，光泽暗淡，不透明，用手摸之，光滑细腻。不溶于水，部分溶于稀液。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-ci9q9mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-ci9q9mc","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-5o2pbg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-5o2pbg0","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 将纯铅放锅内加热炒动，利用空气使之氧化，然后放石臼中研粉，用水漂洗，将粗细粉分开，细粉再经氧化24小时，过筛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-6uax0cd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-6uax0cd","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-j0blidu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-j0blidu","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛、咸，微寒。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-3meuvm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-3meuvm5","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-bgf8fi9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-bgf8fi9","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品有毒，不宜内服，慎防铅中毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-x1o5o3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-x1o5o3v","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-beis2m3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-beis2m3","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拔毒生肌，敛疮。外用治疮疡肿毒，创伤出血，烧烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-jm3jm13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-jm3jm13","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-w53aydl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-w53aydl","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用适量。作为熬制膏药的基础剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-mi4bs95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-mi4bs95","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-2gqd00l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-2gqd00l","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-dcgmoqe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-dcgmoqe","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：铅丹"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-ez4lfx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-ez4lfx2","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-1u3qap5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-1u3qap5","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qiān Dān"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-2gjj55y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-2gjj55y","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-qeml8r3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-qeml8r3","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 丹（《范子计然》），黄丹（《抱朴子》），真丹（《肘后方》），铅华（《别录》），丹粉（《唐本草》），红丹、虢丹（《续本事方》），国丹（《秘传外科方》），朱粉（《纲目》），松丹、东丹（《现代实用中药》），朱丹、陶丹、铅黄（《药材学》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-nl5e7zx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-nl5e7zx","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-caej1dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-caej1dv","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-kx01me5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-kx01me5","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-buruhjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-buruhjz","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"铅"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加工制成的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"四氧化三铅"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-oii0hd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-oii0hd8","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-w7snyjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-w7snyjz","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 产于河南、广东、福建、湖南、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-irocu4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-irocu4d","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-xa82bbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-xa82bbm","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为橙红色或橙黄色的粉末，光泽暗淡，不透明，质重，用手指搓揉，先有沙性触及，后觉细腻，能使手指染成橙黄色。有金属性辛味。以色橙红，细腻光滑，无粗粒，见水不成疙瘩者为佳。不溶于水和酒精，能溶于硝酸，溶于盐酸则放出氯气。炽热之，放出氧气，一部分变为氧化铅。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-z49f6ov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-z49f6ov","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-c7k49j7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-c7k49j7","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《纲目》：\"凡用，以水漂去消盐，飞去砂石，澄干，微火炒紫色，地上去火毒，入药。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-012q64o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-012q64o","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-qvlscqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-qvlscqe","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入心、脾、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-pj385xs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-pj385xs","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《长沙药解》：\"入足少阳胆、足厥阴肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-81zyjkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-81zyjkz","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《要药分剂》：\"入肝、脾两经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-3ikm14q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-3ikm14q","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》：\"入心、肾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-lpves4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-lpves4a","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-ya8hnrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-ya8hnrx","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛咸，寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-y1q5ihy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-y1q5ihy","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味辛，微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-dsg7txo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-dsg7txo","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草发挥》：\"味辛，微寒，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-kioonps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-kioonps","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草正》：\"味辛微咸微涩。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-l7krki6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-l7krki6","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-lcemv7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-lcemv7e","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 虚寒吐逆忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-yp0dqe7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-yp0dqe7","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"吐逆由于胃虚及因寒发吐者，皆不宜服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-6o6y5wj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-6o6y5wj","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草汇言》：\"惊痫由于血虚者，毋乱投也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-pc3dn27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-pc3dn27","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-a7le3i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-a7le3i6","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解毒，生肌，坠痰镇惊。治痈疽，溃疡，金疮出血，口疮，目翳，汤火灼伤，惊痫癫狂，疟疾，痢疾，吐逆反胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-c3yqtcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-c3yqtcw","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主吐逆胃反，惊痫癫疾，除热下气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-ns18ejc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-ns18ejc","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"止小便利，除毒热脐挛，金疮溢血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-hglmf5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-hglmf5l","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"治惊悸狂走，呕逆，消渴。煎膏用，止痛生肌。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-ws7kdjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-ws7kdjz","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"镇心安神，疗反胃，止吐血及嗽，敷金疮，长肉，及汤火疮，染须发，可煎膏。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-02mk9r8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-02mk9r8","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草衍义》：\"治疟及久积。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-ya1eyj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-ya1eyj9","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《医学入门》：\"主中恶心腹胀痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-dhjznvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-dhjznvp","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-l4irht5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-l4irht5","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用：研末撒、调敷；或熬膏。内服：入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-uloawkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-uloawkn","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-zvcezkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-zvcezkm","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治一切痈疽发背，疼痛不止，大渴闷乱，肿硬不可忍：黄丹七两，蜡二、三两，白蔹二两（锉），杏仁三两（汤浸，去皮、尖、双仁，研），乳香二两（末），黄连一、二两（链），生油一升。上药白蔹等三味，以生绵袋盛，入油慢火熬半日，滤出，下黄丹，以柳木蓖搅，候变黑，膏成，入蜡，乳香更熬，硬软得所，用瓷盒内盛，故帛摊贴，日二换之。（《圣惠方》黄丹膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-t4it9es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-t4it9es","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治臁疮久不愈，并风癣疥癞血风等疮：黄丹（淘洗七次，净取）一两五钱，黄连五钱，川芎五钱，海螵蛸三钱，轻粉、潮脑、水龙骨。上为极细末，以生桐油调为膏，夹纸做成，着肉面针刺数十孔，第一日用二贴，第二、三日用一贴，第四、五日用一贴，第六、七日以后，三日换一贴。尚存如钱大一处，不能收口，以松香四两，葱头一把，共捣烂，置于碗中，以滚白水冲下，良久去水，取药捻成饼贴疮上。尚有针细一孔，流水不完，取蒜头、葱头内第二层白皮，贴三、四日。（《疡科选粹》黄丹膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-jxa4jam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-jxa4jam","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治破伤水入，肿溃不愈：铅丹、蛤粉等分。上二味，同炒令变色。掺疮上水即出。（《圣济总录》铅丹散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-53vurgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-53vurgz","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治外痔：黄丹、滑石各等分。上为细末。新汲水调涂，日三、五次上。（《婴童百问》丹石散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-1001si7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-1001si7","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治金疮并一切恶疮：上等虢丹、软石膏不以多少（火煅通红）。上细研和令如桃花色。掺伤处。（《百一选方》桃红散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-c5tcifo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-c5tcifo","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治痘毒，脓水淋漓：黄丹、轻粉各五分，黄连末二钱。上研匀。搽患处。（《小儿痘疹方论》丹粉散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-lsk0j7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-lsk0j7m","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治小儿口疮：黄丹一钱，生蜜一两。上相和深瓯盛，甑内蒸令黑为度。每用少许，鸡毛刷蘸口内。（《普济方》大效金丝膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-ew6u2cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-ew6u2cf","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治目赤及翳：铅丹、乌贼骨大小等分。上二味合研细，和白蜜如泥，蒸之半食久，冷，着眼四眦，日一。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-9wn0u2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-9wn0u2z","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治眼卒生珠管：铅丹半两，鲤鱼胆汁量铅丹多少用。上二味，合调如膏。点注目眦中，日三、五次。（《圣济总录》铅丹膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-o7jv1qb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-o7jv1qb","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治汤火伤：黄丹一两，潮脑五钱。为末。以蜜调匀，涂患处。（《疡医大全》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-xsaqf9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-xsaqf9a","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治蝎螫人：黄丹醋涂之。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-exzfj0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-exzfj0i","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治风痫：铅丹二两，白矾二两。为末，用砖一口，以纸铺砖上，先以丹铺纸上，次以矾铺丹上，然后将十斤柳木柴烧过为度，取出细研。每服三至五分，温酒下。（《博济方》驱风散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-7rdm0it","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-7rdm0it","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治赤白痢：黄丹一两（炒令紫色），黄连一两（去须，微炒）。上药捣罗为末，以面糊和丸，如麻子大。每服，煎生姜、甘草汤下五丸。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-k7xvn67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-k7xvn67","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治消渴：铅丹二两，栝楼八两，茯苓、甘草（炙）各一两半，麦冬八两（去心）。上五味捣筛为散。旦以浆服方寸匕，日二。（《千金翼方》铅丹散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-wxlqp4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-wxlqp4z","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治腋气：腻粉、明矾、红丹各等分。上为末。临睡时抹之。（《续本事方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-u52rp84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-u52rp84","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-hoy1073","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-hoy1073","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草衍义补遗》：\"丹出于铅而曰无毒，又曰凉，予观窃有疑焉。曾见中年一妇人，因多子，于月内服铅丹二两，四肢冰冷强直，食不入口。时正仲冬，急服理中汤加附子，数帖而安，谓之凉而无毒可乎?\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-odc9q4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-odc9q4k","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"铅丹，体重而性沉，味兼盐、矾，走血分，能坠痰去怯，故治惊痫癫狂，吐逆反胃。能消积杀虫，故治疳疾、下痢、疟疾有实积。能解热拔毒，长肉去瘀，故治恶疮肿毒，及入膏药，为外科必用之物也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-10233jv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-10233jv","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"制法"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-qeflndq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-qeflndq","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 将纯铅放在铁锅中加热，炒动，利用空气使之氧化，然后放在石臼中研成粉末。用水漂洗，将粗细粉末分开，漂出之细粉，再经氧化24小时，研成细粉过筛即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-lfguvru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-lfguvru","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-twbf9xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-twbf9xh","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-g95fosv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-g95fosv","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：铅丹"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-pj16yyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-pj16yyz","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-30ridw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-30ridw3","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qiān Dān"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-3gjn3rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-3gjn3rw","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-1mybv5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-1mybv5i","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 丹、黄丹、真丹、铅华、丹粉、黄龙肝、红丹、虢丹、国丹、铅黄、黄虢丹、朱粉、松丹、东丹、朱丹、陶丹、障丹、桃丹粉"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-omigq51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-omigq51","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-uyogap6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-uyogap6","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" red lead， minium"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-ymvpwwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-ymvpwwu","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-49xmkq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-49xmkq2","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-n0ojzzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-n0ojzzt","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-hvpefp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-hvpefp1","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为用铅加工制成的四氧化三铅。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-m1sjono","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-m1sjono","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名："}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-84molug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-84molug","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-dqg70v3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-dqg70v3","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 产于河南、广东、福建、湖南、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-ld0mdra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-ld0mdra","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-289tk2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-289tk2c","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品为橙红色或橙黄色粉末。不透明；土状光泽。体重，质细腻，易吸湿结块，手触之染指。无臭，无味。以色橙红、细腻润滑、遇水不结块者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-bwdexuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-bwdexuz","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-kfequ2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-kfequ2t","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主要成分为四氧化三铅(Pb3O4)。或写作2PbO·PbO2，理论上PbO2为34.9%，但实际上优质品为23-25%。铅丹的红色颇不相同，但与Pb3O4含量则无甚关系。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-y2oiohj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-y2oiohj","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-espelsq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-espelsq","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 铅丹能直接杀灭细菌、寄生虫，并有制止粘液分泌的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-tl3nkqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-tl3nkqs","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-a9s9lli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-a9s9lli","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《纲目》：凡用，以水漂去消盐，飞去砂石，澄干，微火炒紫色，地上去火毒，入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-l6iw97w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-l6iw97w","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-gu3gu09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-gu3gu09","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (1)取本品粉末约0.2g，加热盐酸后，有氯气产生，可使碘化钾淀粉试纸变色；并产生白色氯化铅沉淀。（检查铅盐）（2）取本品粉末约0.2g，加稀硝酸，使其溶解，滤过，取滤液3ml加铬酸钾试液2ml，产生黄色沉淀，分离，沉淀加2mol/L氢氧化铵试液或2mol/L稀硝酸试液均不溶解；加2mol/L氢氧化钠试液，沉淀即溶解。（检查铅盐）（3）取本品少许，置火柴杆上燃烧，可见有密集的微小铅粒。（检查铅盐）（4）X射线衍射分析曲线 6.23(1),3.37(10),3.10(2),2.90(4)，2.78（4），2.62（3），2.25（1），2.03（1），1.96（1），1.82(1),1.75(2)。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-bzw0efh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-bzw0efh","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-go1xeno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-go1xeno","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心；脾；肝；胆；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-jj4ityv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-jj4ityv","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-7pr5q2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-7pr5q2h","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛；咸；寒；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-n7vq8h2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-n7vq8h2","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-0isjtbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-0isjtbl","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 虚寒吐逆忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-wru1b8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-wru1b8n","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草经疏》：吐逆由于胃虚及因寒发吐者，皆不宜服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-g6c9qu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-g6c9qu3","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草汇言》：惊癎由于血虚者，毋乱投也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-0wvv1p4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-0wvv1p4","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-yo5rqlr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-yo5rqlr","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解毒祛腐；收湿敛疮；坠痰镇惊。主痈疽疮疡；外痔；湿疹；烧烫伤；溃疡；金疮出血；口疮；目翳；惊痫癫狂；疟疾；痢疾；吐逆反胃"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-w3jc5rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-w3jc5rh","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-zdqst7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-zdqst7t","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用：研末撒、调敷；或熬膏。内服：入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-4x0v70q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-4x0v70q","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-znxc8gp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-znxc8gp","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治一切痈疽发背，疼痛不止，大渴闷乱，肿硬不可忍，黄丹七两，蜡二、三两，白蔹二两(锉)，杏仁三两(汤浸，去皮；尖、双仁，研)，乳香二两(末)，黄连一、二两(锉)，生油一升。上药白蔹等三味，以生锦袋盛，入油慢火熬半日，滤出，下黄丹，以柳木篦搅，候变黑，膏成，入蜡，乳香更熬，硬软得所，用瓷盒内盛，故帛摊贴，日二换之。(《圣惠方》黄丹膏)②治臁疮久不愈，并风癣疥癞血风等疮：黄丹(淘洗七次，净取)一两五钱，黄连五钱，川芎五钱，海螵蛸三钱，轻粉、潮脑、水龙骨。上为极细末，以生桐油调为膏，夹纸做成，着肉面针刺数十孔，第一日用二贴，第二、三日用一贴，第四、五日用一贴，第六、七日以后，三日换一贴。尚存如钱大一处，不能收口，以松香四两，葱头一把，共捣烂，置于碗中，以滚白水冲下，良久去水，取药捻成饼贴疮上。尚有针细一孔，流水不完，取蒜头、葱头内第二层白皮，贴三、四日。(《疡科选粹》黄丹膏)③治破伤水入，肿溃不愈：铅丹、蛤粉等分。上二味，同炒令变色。掺疮上水即出。(《圣济总录》铅丹散)④治外痔：黄丹、滑石各等分。上为细末。新汲水调涂，日三、五次上。(《婴童百问》丹石散)⑤治金疮并一切恶疮：上等虢丹、软石膏不以多少(火煅通红)。上细研和令如桃花色。掺伤处。(《百一选方》桃红散)⑥治痘毒，脓水淋漓：黄丹、轻粉各五分，黄连末二钱。上研匀。搽患处。(《小儿痘疹方论》丹粉散)⑦治小儿口疮：黄丹一钱，生蜜一两。上相和深瓯盛，甑内蒸令黑为度。每用少许，鸡毛刷蘸口内。(《普济方》大效金丝膏)，⑧治目赤及翳：铅丹、乌贼骨大小等分。上二味合研细，和白蜜如泥，蒸之半食久，冷，着眼四眦，日一。(《千金方》＞⑨治眼卒生珠管：铅丹半两，鲤鱼胆汁量铅丹多少用。上二味，合调如膏。点注目眦中，日三、五次。(《圣济总录》铅丹膏)⑩治汤火伤：黄丹一两，潮脑五钱。为末。以蜜调匀，涂患处。(《疡医大全》)11.治蝎螫人：黄丹醋涂之。(《补缺肘后方》)12.治风癎：铅丹二两，白矾二两。为末，用砖一口，以纸铺砖上，先以丹铺纸上，次以矾铺丹上，然后将十斤柳木柴烧过为度，取出细研。每服三至五分，温酒下。(《博济方》驱风散)13.治赤白痢：黄丹一两(炒令紫色)，黄连一两(去须。微炒)。上药捣罗为末，以面糊和丸，如麻子大。每服，煎生姜、甘草汤下五丸。(《圣惠方》)14.治消渴：铅丹二两，栝楼八两，茯苓、甘草(炙)各一两半，麦冬八两(去心)。上五味捣筛为散。旦以浆服方寸匕，日二。(《千金翼方》铅丹散)15.治腋气：腻粉、明矾、红丹各等分。上为末。临睡时抹之。(《续本事方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-shoaazf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-shoaazf","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-7jloly2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-7jloly2","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主吐逆胃反，惊癎癫疾，除热下气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-xzx1suk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-xzx1suk","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：止小便利，除毒热脐挛，金疮溢血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-ezueibd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-ezueibd","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性论》：治惊悸狂走，呕逆，消渴。煎膏用，止痛生肌。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-wuvq1p4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-wuvq1p4","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《日华子本草》：镇心安神，疗反胃，止吐血及嗽，敷金疮，长肉，及汤火疮，染须发，可煎膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-qaolkz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-qaolkz6","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草衍义》：治疟及久积。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-fypqmwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-fypqmwh","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《医学入门》：主中恶心腹胀痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-gi7aatm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-gi7aatm","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草衍义补遗》：丹出于铅而曰无毒，又曰凉，予观窃有疑焉。曾见中年一妇人，因多子，于月内服铅丹二两，四肢冰冷强直，食不入口。时正仲冬，急服理中汤加附子，数帖而安，谓之凉而无毒可乎？8.《纲目》：铅丹，体重而性沉，味兼盐、矾，走血分，能坠痰去怯，故治惊癎癫狂，吐逆反胃。能消积杀虫，故治疳疾、下痢、疟疾有实积。能解热拔毒，长肉去瘀，故治恶疮肿毒、及入膏药，为外科必用之物也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-x9onj0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-x9onj0m","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612155247-04l9p9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155247-04l9p9l","updated":"20240612155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155207-la3uctb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155207-la3uctb"}},{"ID":"20240612155208-ba6qb4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155208-ba6qb4t"}},{"ID":"20240612155208-h05215e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155208-h05215e"}},{"ID":"20240612155208-wb5xy0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155208-wb5xy0w"}},{"ID":"20240612155208-3g1gkck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155208-3g1gkck"}},{"ID":"20240612155208-w1o7hk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155208-w1o7hk2"}}]}